  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;... (i)</p><p>and&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;...(ii)<br />Multiplying by matrix <math><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;in eq. (ii), we get,<br /><math><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></math><br /><math><mi>I</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi></math><br />Now, multiplying by matrix <math><mi>B</mi></math>, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;(from (i))</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
